    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy present New to Market, a detached dormer and a half style 4 bedroom residence set on 0.42 acre site, c. 4 km from the picturesque vaiilage of Tarmonbarry. Enjoy peaceful rural living with excellent accessibility, located just minutes from the N5 National Primary Route, 12 km from Longford Town, and within easy reach of the Dublin-Sligo Intercity rail line. Requiring refurbishment , the said property is being sold as is and offers obvious potential as a quality family home. Accommodation comprises: Entrance Hallway, Kitchen, utility, W.C, open plan kitchen,dining,sitting room, Reception Room, Ensuite Bedroom at ground floor level together with 3 Bedrooms and a Bathroom at first floor. Immediate Enquiries are advised. \n\nOutside\no.42 acre site. 2 no outbuildings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attractive Style - Dormer and a half\n4 bedrooms, 2 ensuites, separate W.C and family bathroom\nOpen Plan Kitchen Layout\nRequiring Refurb opportunity to finish to your own taste \nAttractive Location \nAccommodation comprises: Entrance Hallway, Kitchen, utility, W.C, open plan kitchen,dining,sitting room, 1 no. Reception Room, Ensuite Bedroom at ground floor level together with 3 Bedrooms ( 1 ensuite) and a Bathroom at first floor. \n Services available. Septic Tank on site. \n Tarmonbarry is renowned as one of the most vibrant, award-winning waterside villages in Irelands Hidden Heartlands. The said property is perfectly positioned just 4 km from this award-winning waterside village and offers an exceptional lifestyle with top-tier amenities on its doorstep. Residents can enjoy premium riverside dining at the renowned Keenanâ??s Hotel & Restaurant and The Purple Onion, or explore outdoor recreation at the local Shannon Marina and the scenic Royal Canal Way. Daily needs are easily met by the village's comprehensive Centra supermarket and primary school, while the major retail parks, secondary schools, and transport hubs of Longford Town are just a short 10 minute drive away."
      },
      {
